{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-06-28 14:28:00', 'title': "ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER CELEBRATES SAFETY EXCELLENCE MILESTONES IN THE COMPANY'S SOUTHERN ILLINOIS SERVICE AREA", 'text': "ALTON, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER IS HIGHLIGHTING SAFETY EXCELLENCE ACHIEVED BY THE COMPANY'S SOUTHERN ILLINOIS TEAMS DURING NATIONAL SAFETY MONTH. THE TEAM MEMBERS CELEBRATED SEVERAL YEARS OF OPERATION WITHOUT LOST-TIME ACCIDENTS. THE GRAFTON WASTEWATER SERVICE TEAM CELEBRATED SEVEN YEARS IN MAY; AND THE JERSEYVILLE WATER AND WASTEWATER TEAMS CELEBRATED NINE YEARS AT THE BEGINNING OF JUNE. ETHAN STEINACHER, SENIOR MANAGER OF OPERATIONS, CREDITED THE TEAMS FOR THEIR COMMITME"}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-06-28 11:47:00', 'title': 'PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER CUSTOMERS REACH $5 MILLION MILESTONE IN NEW BILL ASSISTANCE PROGRAM', 'text': 'MECHANICSBURG, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #LIHWAP--THE NEW LOW-INCOME HOUSEHOLD WATER ASSISTANCE PROGRAM HAS PROVIDED $5 MILLION IN BILL ASSISTANCE TO PENNSYLVANIA AMERICAN WATER CUSTOMERS IN NEED.'}